{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lh2coi3vhk2f","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","uri":"at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lh2coi3vhk2f","cid":"bafyreicoj7mz5bcspkn2xt23gnrvuhwq25y2k3mw5zum4xqadhvuh4rk64","auteur_did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/kbencheikh.bsky.social/post/3lh2coi3vhk2f","date":"2025-01-31T15:25:59.262Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-01-31T15:26:04.753Z","text":"Nous devons préserver les activités et le financement de @unrwa.org !\nAvec plus d'une soixantaine de collègues députés, nous adressons ce courrier transpartisan à @emmanuel-macron.bsky.social ⤵️","facets":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet","features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention","did":"did:plc:dollpxkhuuxwkhraj5dxcr2q"}],"index":{"byteEnd":69,"byteStart":59}},{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet","features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention","did":"did:plc:66w77ofqei4em6y6ysnisxsm"}],"index":{"byteEnd":197,"byteStart":169}}],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"images":[{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/bafkreicz6b2f7bcqr2wllma6d26ag6vxpn4ptubnjmop6g3akirdueuin4","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/bafkreicz6b2f7bcqr2wllma6d26ag6vxpn4ptubnjmop6g3akirdueuin4","alt":"","ar":{"height":1755,"width":1242}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/bafkreibh7gaa6g2cck5ofeseswduw36gw7owchfv3sfpi3nwzgg3hs4cbi","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/bafkreibh7gaa6g2cck5ofeseswduw36gw7owchfv3sfpi3nwzgg3hs4cbi","alt":"","ar":{"height":1755,"width":1242}},{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/bafkreigwz6o7ac3bwynwd5krud6oteqgukbnr6ie7tgcistjxbfyaios6m","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/bafkreigwz6o7ac3bwynwd5krud6oteqgukbnr6ie7tgcistjxbfyaios6m","alt":"","ar":{"height":1755,"width":1242}}]},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgzx4r3mdk2a","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn","uri":"at://did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgzx4r3mdk2a","cid":"bafyreidba7p7w5tturphyon2i7ak6aqokbf7fnlmcml5jvkpjeedrja2xu","auteur_did":"did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/agenetet.bsky.social/post/3lgzx4r3mdk2a","date":"2025-01-31T11:59:13.565Z","type":"quote","indexe":"2025-01-31T11:59:16.451Z","text":"Le Conseil constitutionnel a rendu ce matin sa décision : il rejette 2 recours en annulation de mon élection lors des législatives anticipées.\n\nPar leurs décisions, les Sages jouent un rôle fondamental de garants de notre démocratie, du respect des règles électorales et de la légitimité du scrutin.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"images":[{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/bafkreid2js7ycrvpxinjc2nbmgd7hm6eonqwz6hh5wwqfg37ulfszfuuje","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/bafkreid2js7ycrvpxinjc2nbmgd7hm6eonqwz6hh5wwqfg37ulfszfuuje","alt":"","ar":{"height":1643,"width":1206}}],"quote":{"name":"Conseil constitutionnel","handle":"conseil-constitutionnel.fr","text":"Décisions AN du 31 janvier 2025\n➡️ www.conseil-constitutionnel.fr/les-decision...","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/conseil-constitutionnel.fr/post/3lgzpp2f2pk23","date":"2025-01-31T09:46:17.354Z"}},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcncpnza2w","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","uri":"at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcncpnza2w","cid":"bafyreiezupqoiemz4negkji6jzw52yfvkap5dplboikxbdvulu26mhoyt4","auteur_did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/kbencheikh.bsky.social/post/3lgvcncpnza2w","date":"2025-01-29T15:41:57.039Z","type":"reply","indexe":"2025-01-29T15:42:04.927Z","text":"Collègues parlementaires, membres de la CMP, soutiens du gouvernement, réveillez-vous ! Assumez les convictions que vous formulez du bout des lèvres ou dans les travées de nos hémicycles et votez en conséquence !\n👉 lc.cx/5G1BkC","facets":[{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#link","uri":"https://lc.cx/5G1BkC"}],"index":{"byteEnd":236,"byteStart":224}}],"author":null,"replyTo":{"name":"Karim Ben Cheikh","handle":"kbencheikh.bsky.social"},"embed":{"link":{"uri":"https://lc.cx/5G1BkC","title":"Budget 2025 : le Sénat vote une coupe budgétaire de 35 % dans l’aide publique au développement - Public Sénat","desc":"C’est l’une des missions du budget les plus mise à contribution pour redresser les finances du pays. Dans le cadre de l’examen du projet de loi de finances, les sénateurs ont voté, pour certains « à c...","thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/bafkreidehli7bga3zd4jyqlqt4di6y5vrq2yq2blsp4lru4a7vpmc4qore"}},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcncpmzy2w","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","uri":"at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcncpmzy2w","cid":"bafyreighaqso3lac6yjsfkfzxwql6fecuhywxx47qd5z5ulhsrdonx5ijy","auteur_did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/kbencheikh.bsky.social/post/3lgvcncpmzy2w","date":"2025-01-29T15:41:57.038Z","type":"reply","indexe":"2025-01-29T15:42:04.910Z","text":"Alors qu’il est essentiel de se donner les moyens de faire face aux convulsions du monde, que les questions internationales n’ont jamais autant impacté nos compatriotes, ce gouvernement montre son manque de vision. La France doit avoir les moyens d'une diplomatie forte. 💪","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":{"name":"Karim Ben Cheikh","handle":"kbencheikh.bsky.social"},"embed":null,"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcncpmzx2w","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","uri":"at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcncpmzx2w","cid":"bafyreibsgm7hssbuv7aghwup54fdgjqn4zx2szwuaurbjts7jba4hlg4dm","auteur_did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/kbencheikh.bsky.social/post/3lgvcncpmzx2w","date":"2025-01-29T15:41:57.037Z","type":"reply","indexe":"2025-01-29T15:42:04.892Z","text":"Tant sur l’APD - dont la loi de 2021 fixait l’objectif d’atteindre 0,7% du RNB par an - que sur le budget de la diplomatie, le gouvernement saborde la 🇫🇷 à l’international. Cet effacement a des effets perceptibles sur les grands dossiers internationaux et menace nos intérêts.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":{"name":"Karim Ben Cheikh","handle":"kbencheikh.bsky.social"},"embed":null,"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcncpm2p2w","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","uri":"at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcncpm2p2w","cid":"bafyreigimv7364ffuwxpq2ln2ec6kus737vqzm4hxlxtucotpwldu76i3u","auteur_did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/kbencheikh.bsky.social/post/3lgvcncpm2p2w","date":"2025-01-29T15:41:57.036Z","type":"reply","indexe":"2025-01-29T15:42:04.874Z","text":"Alors que les gouvernements Attal puis Barnier ont procédé à des annulations de crédits, le gouvernement Bayrou a fait voter une nouvelle coupe de 175 millions d’euros pour 2025 soit 4% du budget, enfonçant le dernier clou dans le cercueil des promesses des Etats généraux 😞","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":{"name":"Karim Ben Cheikh","handle":"kbencheikh.bsky.social"},"embed":null,"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcncpm2o2w","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","uri":"at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcncpm2o2w","cid":"bafyreigxkc76dohgnu55b2xahuw4trlm5xbzs3tymv5rezcqqf6dq6msfu","auteur_did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/kbencheikh.bsky.social/post/3lgvcncpm2o2w","date":"2025-01-29T15:41:57.035Z","type":"reply","indexe":"2025-01-29T15:42:04.857Z","text":"Le budget 2024, adopté après ces États généraux, semblait prometteur : création de 116 postes + préservation des crédits. Mais bientôt, c'est la douche froide : 233 millions d’euros d’annulation de crédits en 2024. Le “réarmement diplomatique” ? Un pétard mouillé ! 🧨","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":{"name":"Karim Ben Cheikh","handle":"kbencheikh.bsky.social"},"embed":null,"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcn6lijg2w","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","uri":"at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcn6lijg2w","cid":"bafyreifrk7xdjng35lldqowd7ip4rjlwrzficgfkzwqs2feiyey3tzqcgy","auteur_did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/kbencheikh.bsky.social/post/3lgvcn6lijg2w","date":"2025-01-29T15:41:57.034Z","type":"reply","indexe":"2025-01-29T15:42:04.839Z","text":"Quand le Quai d’Orsay se rebelle, ça surprend. En 2022, une grève inédite avait alerté. Des “États généraux de la diplomatie” sont organisés et le président promet alors +700 postes et +22% de budget d'ici 2027. \n👉 Son discours ici : lc.cx/3Yrc9m","facets":[{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#link","uri":"https://lc.cx/3Yrc9m"}],"index":{"byteEnd":264,"byteStart":252}}],"author":null,"replyTo":{"name":"Karim Ben Cheikh","handle":"kbencheikh.bsky.social"},"embed":{"link":{"uri":"https://lc.cx/3Yrc9m","title":"Clôture des États généraux de la diplomatie.","desc":"Le Président de la République s'est rendu au Ministère de l’Europe et des Affaires étrangères, à l’occasion de la clôture des États Généraux de la diplomatie jeudi 16 mars.","thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/bafkreif5dt3fue3mugnox4o7c7i5dfl5nf5r3fe6whf6vnseqw77u2hqou"}},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcn6lhk62w","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","uri":"at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcn6lhk62w","cid":"bafyreiczqdiz4g3nx6zb6inxlkwre67m2myjecvctaaofxhju3vhenu3zu","auteur_did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/kbencheikh.bsky.social/post/3lgvcn6lhk62w","date":"2025-01-29T15:41:57.033Z","type":"reply","indexe":"2025-01-29T15:42:04.822Z","text":"Le budget diplomatique pèse seulement 0,6% des dépenses de l’Etat (vs 1% en 1981). Le Quai d'Orsay est le “bon élève” des réductions de fonctionnaires : il a perdu 30% de ses effectifs en 15 ans, sans création nette de postes depuis 1991.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":{"name":"Karim Ben Cheikh","handle":"kbencheikh.bsky.social"},"embed":null,"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcn6lhk52w","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","uri":"at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcn6lhk52w","cid":"bafyreiec3kurumoynmlycv2gura5dg62jomy3po47nc3ouuawvt6jxouz4","auteur_did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/kbencheikh.bsky.social/post/3lgvcn6lhk52w","date":"2025-01-29T15:41:57.032Z","type":"reply","indexe":"2025-01-29T15:42:04.782Z","text":"En plus, cette baisse déstabilise les ambassades : moins de moyens pour leur action de coopération et pour leurs réseaux locaux. Depuis 30 ans, les diplomates entendent “faire mieux avec moins”, mais maintenant, ça va être \"faire mieux avec rien\". 😤","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":{"name":"Karim Ben Cheikh","handle":"kbencheikh.bsky.social"},"embed":null,"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcn6lhk42w","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","uri":"at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcn6lhk42w","cid":"bafyreiahhsrcx7duhlfhmrqyu2wforxip7zpvidd2etm4o7vob6jcxxaiu","auteur_did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/kbencheikh.bsky.social/post/3lgvcn6lhk42w","date":"2025-01-29T15:41:57.031Z","type":"reply","indexe":"2025-01-29T15:42:04.762Z","text":" L’APD finance des actions sociales cruciales menées par les ONG locales dans les pays partenaires. Cette coupe menace directement leur survie, comme l’ont souligné des associations féministes africaines \n👉 urls.fr/YNRgAh","facets":[{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#link","uri":"https://urls.fr/YNRgAh"}],"index":{"byteEnd":231,"byteStart":217}}],"author":null,"replyTo":{"name":"Karim Ben Cheikh","handle":"kbencheikh.bsky.social"},"embed":null,"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcn6lgku2w","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","uri":"at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcn6lgku2w","cid":"bafyreiey4zz2h2o2wxch6bxfg5n5eurstrbncj5yttm5nqtt6tgmlbhlmi","auteur_did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/kbencheikh.bsky.social/post/3lgvcn6lgku2w","date":"2025-01-29T15:41:57.030Z","type":"reply","indexe":"2025-01-29T15:42:04.744Z","text":"Mieux encore, chaque euro investi provoque un effet levier considérable. Remy Rioux affirmait ainsi devant la commission des Affaires étrangères que lorsque l'AFD injecte 1€, ce sont plus de 12€ qui sont en réalité investis. 👉 lc.cx/uo9S6T","facets":[{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#link","uri":"https://lc.cx/uo9S6T"}],"index":{"byteEnd":251,"byteStart":239}}],"author":null,"replyTo":{"name":"Karim Ben Cheikh","handle":"kbencheikh.bsky.social"},"embed":null,"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcn6lcnu2w","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","uri":"at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcn6lcnu2w","cid":"bafyreihmljzbmzs7se3mfwrudaaqegjmcwnzb2h5rnw4nti7uoaxyaer6e","auteur_did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/kbencheikh.bsky.social/post/3lgvcn6lcnu2w","date":"2025-01-29T15:41:57.029Z","type":"reply","indexe":"2025-01-29T15:42:04.728Z","text":"Rappel : l'APD, ce n’est pas de l’aumône ! 90% de ces fonds sont des prêts à taux bas pour les pays en développement. Sur un projet anti-CO2, chaque euro investi en APD est un euro efficace (cf @RonanDantec 👉 lc.cx/Pcsr0h)","facets":[{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#link","uri":"https://lc.cx/Pcsr0h"}],"index":{"byteEnd":232,"byteStart":220}}],"author":null,"replyTo":{"name":"Karim Ben Cheikh","handle":"kbencheikh.bsky.social"},"embed":{"link":{"uri":"https://lc.cx/Pcsr0h","title":"x.com","desc":""}},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcn6lbom2w","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","uri":"at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcn6lbom2w","cid":"bafyreiaxr7da2a3hezmmrdxkbwlioz5pimhd4e4jlkvbodyuf5uofl4yry","auteur_did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/kbencheikh.bsky.social/post/3lgvcn6lbom2w","date":"2025-01-29T15:41:57.028Z","type":"reply","indexe":"2025-01-29T15:42:04.713Z","text":"Le programme 209 qui regroupe les moyens de coopération et de solidarité de la France, perd à lui seul plus 50% de son budget vs 2024. Un retrait sans précédent !","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":{"name":"Karim Ben Cheikh","handle":"kbencheikh.bsky.social"},"embed":null,"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
