{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcn6l5rm2w","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","uri":"at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcn6l5rm2w","cid":"bafyreign7v6ngclfbhhzbnl5rz6y7mpsvk3t6rrgbcp2zy2uek5quqb5eu","auteur_did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/kbencheikh.bsky.social/post/3lgvcn6l5rm2w","date":"2025-01-29T15:41:57.026Z","type":"reply","indexe":"2025-01-29T15:42:04.684Z","text":"Les coupes touchent 2 lignes cruciales du budget diplomatique :\n1️⃣ “Aide Publique au Développement” (APD) pour les pays en développement\n2️⃣ “Action extérieure de l’État” : ambassades, consulats, instituts & lycées français, actions sociales pour 2,5 millions de français à l'étranger.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":{"name":"Karim Ben Cheikh","handle":"kbencheikh.bsky.social"},"embed":null,"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcn6kkam2w","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","uri":"at://did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgvcn6kkam2w","cid":"bafyreie34ubowyrfcjvu6lgnqh6rijhrwfy4efsnc6nrj3menvvjbugnju","auteur_did":"did:plc:rajo2u37vabj7ydnpp6a3win","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/kbencheikh.bsky.social/post/3lgvcn6kkam2w","date":"2025-01-29T15:41:57.025Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-01-29T15:42:04.664Z","text":"Ce gouvernement organise l’affaiblissement diplomatique de la France.  Appuyé par les macronistes alliés de la droite et de l’extrême-droite, il s'apprête à faire adopter en commission mixte paritaire (#CMP) un #budget2025 qui mène notre diplomatie au point de bascule. #Thread 🧵⤵️","facets":[{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag","tag":"budget2025"}],"index":{"byteEnd":231,"byteStart":220}},{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag","tag":"Thread"}],"index":{"byteEnd":287,"byteStart":280}}],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":null,"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:rp:did:plc:ij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd:at://did:plc:xnyqu62hsxxc5kuvsoxtvfrm/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgt2aniqwc2a","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:ij2zfnls7gz6rwailozlrcwd","uri":"at://did:plc:xnyqu62hsxxc5kuvsoxtvfrm/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgt2aniqwc2a","cid":"bafyreibhp3q6hmdcvee2d5kyn2x3zt56ietn4kytkf24o4kvlg4az5a534","auteur_did":"did:plc:xnyqu62hsxxc5kuvsoxtvfrm","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/valeriehayer.bsky.social/post/3lgt2aniqwc2a","date":"2025-01-29T14:03:23.852Z","type":"repost","indexe":"2025-01-29T14:03:23.852Z","text":"🔴 Bien arrivée à Reykjavík pour un déplacement en Islande et au Groenland.\n\nDans un contexte de tensions géopolitiques accrues, il est impératif que l’Europe se dote d’une véritable stratégie arctique auprès de nos partenaires.\n\nÀ la rencontre des autorités politiques et de la société civile.","facets":[],"author":{"name":"Valérie Hayer","handle":"valeriehayer.bsky.social","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/valeriehayer.bsky.social"},"replyTo":null,"embed":{"images":[{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:xnyqu62hsxxc5kuvsoxtvfrm/bafkreie3ocl3s7xj4mv4fj42hhrilqqbdmyn7yv4cjn6liwpfiavu5h4au","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:xnyqu62hsxxc5kuvsoxtvfrm/bafkreie3ocl3s7xj4mv4fj42hhrilqqbdmyn7yv4cjn6liwpfiavu5h4au","alt":"","ar":{"height":900,"width":900}}]},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
